# Trusted qualification Host Source handoff

Status: **NEW REVISION SOURCE_PROPOSED / NOT COMPILED / NOT EXECUTED**. This directory derives from the immutable previous Host Source and contains four Windows-only Go files, two input templates and a GO-authority template. The previous four-file Source had a successful named-files build; this changed revision has not been built. No native Host, CLI, provider, DB, qualification, acceptance, or outer Job operation has been run by this author. Compilation alone is not runtime qualification.

## Exact Source pins

The local `manifest.json` lists every proposed file and inspected Main evidence with SHA-256 and byte count. Its own hash is supplied to Root separately because it contains this handoff.

